OL,3,GNEWSAEnvironment department failing to
OL,4,Aprotect wild birds, OEP finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation has found the
OL,7,FDepartment of Agriculture, Environment
OL,8,Fand Rural Affairs is failing to protect
OL,9,Fwild birds.
OL,11,FThe Office for Environmental Protection
OL,12,Fsaid Daera had not complied with
OL,13,Fenvironmental law requiring it to
OL,14,Fclassify and update Special Protection
OL,15,FAreas (SPAs).
OL,17,FThe minister said it was "uncomfortable
OL,18,Freading".
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
