OL,3,GNEWSAEnvironment department failing to
OL,4,Aprotect wild birds, OEP finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FSPAs are home to rare and threatened
OL,7,Fbirds like the curlew and whooper swan,
OL,8,Fwhich continue to decline in Northern
OL,9,FIreland.
